  "headline": "Nitrofurantoin is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale sites hold ~25.7 days on hand and the best alternate manufacturer option is Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include nitrofurantoin as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 353 capsules of the 50 mg presentation at 13.7 per day, providing 25.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 409 capsules of the 50 mg presentation at 15.9 per day, also providing 25.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule ranks buying from Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited as the top alternate manufacturer option, noting it is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited is named on a product label with FEI 3004956904 and a registered plant link, though the label does not name a plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["E9", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that FEI show multiple VAI classifications from 2010 through 2020, with the most recent inspection ending 2020-03-13.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Separately, FDA's shortage list shows Amneal Pharmaceuticals' nitrofurantoin oral suspension posted as To Be Discontinued on 2026-04-10, which may affect other presentations.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    }
  ]
}
